GAL16V8
DECODE

NC A15 A14 A13 MREQn RDn WRn NC NC GND
NC NC NC NC NC MEMWRn MEMRDn RAMn ROMn VCC

ROMn   = MREQn + A15 + A14 + A13
RAMn   = MREQn + /A15
MEMRDn = MREQn + RDn
MEMWRn = MREQn + WRn

DESCRIPTION
Illustrative DIP20 address decoder, not an assigned 7xsys board pinout.
Active-low ROM select at 0000-1FFF; RAM select at 8000-FFFF.
Both selects require MREQn low; they are not qualified by RDn/WRn.
MEMRDn/MEMWRn are separately qualified memory read/write strobes.
Unused input-only pins need defined board levels. NC is a source marker.
